WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Since I fought off my parents, I thought I had climbed to a high branch

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,560
But now even the little grain reserves of the He family are running low day by day.

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:08,480
I can only come out to see if I can dig out something edible from under the blood.

4
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,120
Miss, this yellow pepper comes from the wild

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,640
Not even a frozen ant can be seen

6
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,040
Where can we find food?

7
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,920
Otherwise, let's go back

8
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,360
Go back. Do you think I want to come out and suffer this?

9
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,680
The city has long been out of food.

10
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:21,080
The stuff in the He family's cellar is almost gone.

11
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,280
Don't come out to find food again

12
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,360
Are you going to starve to death in the house?

13
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,320
Unexpectedly, my majestic Yun family is thousands of pounds

14
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:28,080
To be like those mud legs

15
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,050
Come out to eat

16
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:31,930
Miss, I heard this

17
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:33,970
Makikawa lives halfway up the mountain

18
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:36,490
He has a way to provide physical warmth and food.

19
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:38,130
How about we go and beg him?

20
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:39,570
You were engaged to him before

21
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,250
Just give him a good look and shut up

22
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:42,970
You asked me to beg that poor loser

23
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:44,210
I'd rather starve to death here

24
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:45,210
I will never go
